    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 02/04/2025, the use of the detached outbuilding used as a self-contained unit at 29 Parkfield Road, Feltham, TW13 7LQ was not lawful within the meaning of Section 191 the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reason:\r\nThe evidence supplied does not confirm that on the balance of probabilities the use of the detached outbuilding used as a self-contained unit existed for an uninterrupted period of at least four years prior to the date of submission of this application.\r\n"
